why use a mux server?

1. Mulitplex 
In GO, a mux generally refers to an HTTP request mulitiplexer.

One browser   ->  A Channel
              ->  B Channel 
              ->  C Channel

we say mux , it usually means HTTP request mulitiplexer


http muilitplexr sloves bottlneneck
mulitiplexing does not make your javascrpit smaller or your images
lighter
it reduces the wating the happens while the browser asks for each
asset


